# PINNED SURFACE BASELINE for tools/preflight/surface_diff.sh (via surface_baseline.sh).
#
# The observable surface (CONFIG names, COMMAND names, INFO fields, DEBUG subcommands) of the
# commit below is the ACCEPTED baseline. surface_diff.sh asserts the candidate's surface is
# byte-identical to it. Anything else is a surface change and must be justified.
#
# THIS PIN MUST NOT TRACK HEAD. A baseline that advances with every commit absorbs surface
# changes one commit at a time and detects nothing -- the whole point is that it lags deliberately.
# Move it only when a surface change has been reviewed and accepted, and append a line to the log
# below saying what changed and why.
#
# HOW TO MOVE IT
#   1. Run bigstress; read the SD-SURFACE-* rows to see exactly what was added/removed.
#   2. Confirm every difference is intended (a new INFO counter usually is; a renamed or removed
#      CONFIG almost never is -- that breaks deployed configs).
#   3. Replace the SHA, add a log line, commit both together with the change that caused it.
#
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
# LOG
#   2026-08-02  2c54f89a8  Initial pin. Chosen because it is the last commit to pass a FULL
#               bigstress green (PASS=28 FAIL=0 NA=12) and is the state under the first complete
#               stress_validation soak. Before this pin existed, bigstress defaulted SURFACE_BASE
#               to the candidate itself, so CASE SURFACE-GATE compared a binary against itself and
#               correctly reported INCONCLUSIVE rather than a meaningless PASS.
#
#               KNOWN PENDING DIFF against this pin, intentional, to be folded in when reviewed:
#                 + INFO tomokv_ex_queue_full_xshard  (splits the cross-shard scatter's share out
#                   of tomokv_ex_queue_full so tools/preflight/ex_backpressure.sh can prove WHICH
#                   back-pressure site it entered). Additive only; the existing field keeps its
#                   meaning as the combined total.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

2c54f89a8
